SEC. 51P-743.106. MAIN USES PERMITTED.

(a) Except as provided in this section, the only main uses permitted in this district are those main uses permitted in the A(A) Agricultural District, subject to the same conditions applicable in the A(A) Agricultural District, as set out in Chapter 51A. For example, a use permitted in the A(A) Agricultural District only by specific use permit (SUP) is permitted in this district only by SUP; a use subject to development impact review (DIR) in the A(A) Agricultural District is subject to DIR in this district; etc.

(b) The following main uses are permitted in the following zones only and are located as shown as shown on the conceptual plan:

(1) Private stable is permitted (by right) only in Zone 2 as shown on the conceptual plan;

(2) Church is permitted (by right) only in Zone 1 as shown on the conceptual plan;

(3) Resident, staff, and caretaker lodging is permitted (by right) only in Zone 1 as shown on the conceptual plan;

(4) Patron lodging is permitted (by right) only in Zone 1 as shown on the conceptual plan;

(5) Private recreation center is permitted (by right) in Zones 1, 2, and 3 as shown on the conceptual plan.

(6) Tower/antenna for cellular communication is permitted (by SUP) only in Zone 2 as shown on the conceptual plan.

(7) Overflow parking areas are permitted (by right) only in designated areas in Zones 1, 2, and 3 as shown on the conceptual plan.

(c) Single family residential uses are prohibited in this district. (Ord. 26284)
